  "MeshGraphMLP": "Linear(in\u2192hidden) \u00b7 SiLU \u00b7 [Linear(hidden\u2192hidden) \u00b7 SiLU]\u00d7(hidden_layers\u22121) \u00b7 Linear(hidden\u2192out) \u00b7 LayerNorm(out, eps=1e-5) (no LayerNorm on heads: `*_head`); state names `model.<i>.weight|bias` in Sequential order",
  "input": "each input array x (chunk: chunk_feat \u2016 chunk_qs_feat for variant B; imp: impactor_feat \u2016 impactor_qs_feat; glob: global_feat; edge_<type>: <type>_feat, bond \u2016 bond_qs_feat for B) \u2192 (x \u2212 in_mean_<k>) / in_std_<k> when input_norm",
  "encode": "h[chunk] = enc_chunk(x), h[impactor] = enc_imp(x), g = enc_glob(x), e[type] = enc_edge.<type>(x)",
  "FineRound": "for each edge type: e' = e + edge.<type>.edge_mlp([e, h[src], h[dst]]); h' = h + node.node_mlp([\u03a3_dst e'_bond, \u03a3 e'_cracked, \u03a3 e'_impactor_contact, \u03a3 e'_structure_contact, h, g[call]]); g' = g + glob.mlp([g, mean_call h'])",
  "U": "fine_pre rounds; for each level l: pool (BSMS WeightedEdgeConv weights on level l's live edges, then select h_ids[l+1]), down[l] CoarseRound\u00d7r; up: unpool, edge_conv(aggregating=False), up rounds, + skip; fine level: h = skip0 + unpooled; fine_post rounds (see mgn/bsms.py and outcome/model.py)",
  "CoarseRound": "m = gmp.mlp_edge([fibre, h[i], h[j]]), fibre = (R_body\u1d40(p_i \u2212 p_j)/L, |\u00b7|); h' = h + gmp.mlp_node([h, \u03a3_j m, g[call]]); g' = g + glob.mlp([g, mean h'])",
  "heads": "bond: \u00bd(bond_head([e_fwd, e_rev, h_s, h_d, g]) + bond_head([e_rev, e_fwd, h_d, h_s, g])) \u2192 [log r, break logit, softplus\u2192\u0394damage, log q, time logits\u00d78] (variant B adds bond_qs col 0 to log r); chunk/imp: *_head([h, g]) \u2192 12 body-frame outputs (+ perforation logit for impactors; B adds *_qs to the first 6); energy_head(g)"
